s and outcomes—turning abstract concepts into something you can explore directly.\\n\\nInteractive learning launches with \",\"interactive visual module\",[591],\"When you ask ChatGPT about certain topics, it can now present an \",[5462],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5463,\"_286\":5464},\"Interactive learning for math and science\",[591],[5466],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5467,\"_286\":5468},\"March 10, 2026\",[591],[5470,5471,5472],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5479},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5476},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":5473},[5474],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5475,\"_286\":-7},\"As of March 11, 2026, GPT-5.1 models are no longer available in ChatGPT.\\n\\nThis applies to GPT-5.1 Instant, GPT-5.1 Thinking, and GPT-5.1 Pro. Existing conversations that used GPT-5.1 will automatically continue on the corresponding current model: GPT-5.3 Instant, GPT-5.4 Thinking, or GPT-5.4 Pro.\",[5477],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5478,\"_286\":-7},\"Retiring GPT-5.1 models\",[5480],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5481,\"_286\":5482},\"March 11, 2026\",[591],[5484,5485,5486],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5494},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5490},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":5487},[5488],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5489,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re rolling out an update to GPT-5.3 Instant that improves follow-up tone and reduces teaser-style phrasing in responses (e.g., “If you want…”, “You’ll never believe…”, “I can tell you these three things that…”).\",[5491],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5492,\"_286\":5493},\"GPT-5.3 Instant update\",[591],[5495],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5496,\"_286\":5497},\"March 16, 2026\",[591],[5499,5500,5501,5502,5503,5504,5505,5506,5507,5508,5509],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5603},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5599},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":5596},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":5573},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":5566},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":5562},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":5554},{\"_270\":365,\"_2