809],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5594,\"_286\":-7},[6811],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6812,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re updating the model picker to make it easier to choose the balance of speed and reasoning effort that works best for your task.\\n\\nThe model picker now has the following simplified options: \",[6814],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6815,\"_286\":6816},\"Simplified controls in the model picker\",[591],[6818],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6819,\"_286\":-7},\"June 10, 2026\",[6821,6822,6823,6824,6825],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6887},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6883},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6880},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":6846},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6826},[6827,6828,6829,6830,6831,6832,6833],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6845,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6842,\"_286\":6843},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6841,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6839,\"_286\":6840},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6838,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":6834,\"_274\":6835},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",[6836],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2407,\"_286\":6837},[4475],\" section in the command menu, and clearer usage-limit errors with plan and workspace guidance, including reset timing when available. \",\"Unread chats\",[591],\" command for generating an AGENTS.md project-instructions scaffold, customizable macOS Dock icons, an \",\"/init\",[6844],\"code\",\"Other changes in this release include the \",[6847,6848],[6861],[6849],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6850},[6851,6852,6853],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6860,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":6855,\"_274\":6856},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6854,\"_286\":-7},\" for Browser use in Chrome and the Codex in-app browser. Developer mode gives Codex controlled Chrome DevTools Protocol access so it can profile JavaScript, inspect console output and network traffic, review page state such as the DOM and applied styles, and diagnose live browser issues. The feature is off by default  - users can toggle the feature from Codex app settings.\",\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/app/browser#developer-mode\",[6857],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6858,\"_286\":6859},\"Developer mode\",[4475],\"This release also adds \",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6862},[6863,6864,6865,6866,6867],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6879,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":6874,\"_274\":6875},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6873,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":6868,\"_274\":6869},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"/en/articles/20001271\",[6870],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6871,\"_286\":6872},\"current terms\",[4475],\" and review the \",\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/pricing#invite-friends-and-coworkers\",[6876],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6877,\"_286\":6878},\"Invite friends and coworkers\",[4475],\"Eligible Plus and Pro users now have rate-limit reset banking, including one free reset at launch and the ability to send referral invitations from within the Codex app. When an eligible recipient sends their first Codex message, both people receive a banked rate-limit reset. Banked resets are usable for 30 days after they are granted. Learn more in \",[6881],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6882,\"_286\":-7},\"We’ve made several Codex updates, including:\",[6884],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6885,\"_286\":6886},\"Codex updates\",[591],[6888],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6889,\"_286\":6890},\"June 11, 2026\",[591],[6892,6893,6894,6895,6896,6897,6898],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6927},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6923},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6920},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6916},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6913},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":6902},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6899},[6900],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6901,\"_286\":-7},\"If you don’t want information from a chat to be used to personalize responses, you can turn off memory or use Temporary Chat. Temporary Chats don’t use existing memories or create new memories.\\n\\nMemory updates, including memory summary, are still rolling out across ChatGPT plans and countries. You’ll be notified in ChatGPT when memory updates are available to you.\",[6903,6904],[6909],[6905],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6906},[6907],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6908,\"_286\":-7},\"Highlight any text in the memory summary to make a specific correction.\",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6910},[6911],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6912,\"_286\":-7},\"Type what you want changed into the text box at the bottom of the memory summary, and it will update accordingly.\",[6914],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6915,\"_286\":-7},\"You can now delete the memories shown on your memory summary page and turn memory off by selecting “Delete and turn off memory” from the three-dot menu. This does not delete your past chats. If you turn memory back on later, ChatGPT may create new memories from chats that remain in your chat history. This control is available to all ChatGPT users on the web and rolling out on mobile soon.\\n\\nTo make changes to your memory summary, you can:\",[6917],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6918,\"_286\":6919},\"Additional controls for memory summary\",[591],[6921],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6922,\"_286\":-7},\"As of June 12, 2026, GPT-5.2 models are no longer available in ChatGPT.\\n\\nThis applies to GPT-5.2 Instant, GPT-5.2 Thinking, and GPT-5.2 Pro. Existing conversations that used GPT-5.2 will automatically continue on the corresponding GPT-5.5 model. GPT-5.5 models remain available in ChatGPT.\\n\\nThis retirement was previously announced with the release of GPT-5.3 Instant. Models will generally remain available in ChatGPT for 90 days after a successor is released.\",[6924],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6925,\"_286\":6926},\"Retiring GPT-5.2 models\",[591],[6928],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6929,\"_286\":6930},\"June 12, 2026\",[591],[6932,6933,6934,6935,6936,6937,6938,6939],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6997},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":6994},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6988},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":6967},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6963},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":6947},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6943},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6940},[6941],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6942,\"_286\":-7},\"Pulse is being sunset as proactive updates move into scheduled tasks. Pro users will continue to have access for 14 days from today. To keep receiving daily updates, you can ask ChatGPT to schedule a daily briefing based on your interests and past chats. \",[6944],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6945,\"_286\":6946},\"Update on Pulse\",[591],[6948,6949,6950],[6959],[6955],[6951],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6952},[6953],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6954,\"_286\":-7},\"Tasks cannot run more than once per hour, and unattended tasks may automatically pause after a period of inactivity.\",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6956},[6957],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6958,\"_286\":-7},\"Active task limits vary by tier. \",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6960},[6961],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6962,\"_286\":-7},\"Rolling out to Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise users.\",[6964],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6965,\"_286\":6966},\"Availability and limits\",[591],[6968,6969,6970,6971],[6984],[6980],[6976],[6972],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6973},[6974],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6975,\"_286\":-7},\"Monitoring tasks can search the web and check connected apps for changes and notify users only when there is something worth reporting.\",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6977},[6978],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6979,\"_286\":-7},\"Users can schedule work for specific times or broader windows, such as morning, afternoon, or evening.\",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6981},[6982],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6983,\"_286\":-7},\"All tasks are faster and more reliable.\",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":6985},[6986],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6987,\"_286\":-7},\"A new Scheduled page, discoverable in the sidebar, gives users one place to view active tasks, see when they’ll run next, and pause, resume, edit, or delete them.\",[6989,6990],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6993,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6991,\"_286\":6992},\"What’s changing\",[591],\"With scheduled tasks, users can ask ChatGPT to send reminders, handle recurring work, or monitor things for them. This update makes tasks easier to find and manage, faster and more reliable, with more useful notifications.\\n\\n\",[6995],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1561,\"_286\":6996},[591],[6998],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6999,\"_286\":7000},\"June 17, 2026\",[591],[7002,7003,7004,7005,7006,7007,7008,7009,7010,7011,7012,7013,7014],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7129},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7126},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7123},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7121},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7089},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7086},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7061},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7058},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7049},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7046},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7029},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7025},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7015},[7016,7017,7018],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7024,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7019,\"_274\":7020},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/record-and-replay\",[7021],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7022,\"_286\":7023},\"Record \u0026 Replay guide\",[4475],\"Record \u0026 Replay is a new Codex app feature for macOS that lets eligible users demonstrate a workflow once and turn it into a reusable skill. It is useful for repetitive workflows or tasks that are easier to show than describe, such as creating a configured issue, publishing a video, or downloading a recurring report.\\n\\nRecord \u0026 Replay requires Computer Use to be available and enabled, and initial availability excludes the European Union, UK and Switzerland. Learn more in the \",[7026],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7027,\"_286\":7028},\"Record \u0026 Replay in Codex\",[591],[7030,7031],[7039],[7032],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7033},[7034,7035],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7037,\"_286\":7038},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7036,\"_286\":-7},\": The composer in Android now has inline mentions, and an updated menu for Plugins.\",\"Updated composer and tools menu\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7040},[7041,7042],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7044,\"_286\":7045},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7043,\"_286\":-7},\": Android users on paid plans can now long-press the send button to choose a model for a one-off message without changing their default model.\",\"Long-press send to choose a model\",[591],[7047],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1716,\"_286\":7048},[591],[7050],[7051],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7052},[7053,7054],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7056,\"_286\":7057},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7055,\"_286\":-7},\": Taking and uploading photos in ChatGPT on iOS is now faster and smoother, making it easier to add images to your conversations.\",\"Improved camera and photo uploads\",[591],[7059],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1745,\"_286\":7060},[591],[7062,7063,7064],[7079],[7072],[7065],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7066},[7067,7068],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7070,\"_286\":7071},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7069,\"_286\":-7},\": Highlight text in a ChatGPT response and choose ‘Start writing’ to keep working on it, or save it to your Library to come back to later.\",\"Create a note from a response\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7073},[7074,7075],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7077,\"_286\":7078},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7076,\"_286\":-7},\": Sharing a conversation is now faster, with a one-click flow that no longer opens a separate pop-up.\",\"Easier conversation sharing\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7080},[7081,7082],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7084,\"_286\":7085},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7083,\"_286\":-7},\": It’s now easier to keep important work close in ChatGPT. You can pin chats and projects directly from the sidebar, and your Pinned section now includes both chats and projects. You can also organize Recents as one combined list, or group chats by project so related work stays together.\",\"Easier pinning and sidebar organization\",[591],[7087],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5073,\"_286\":7088},[591],[7090,7091,7092],[7114],[7100],[7093],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7094},[7095,7096],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7098,\"_286\":7099},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7097,\"_286\":-7},\": You can now choose when ChatGPT asks before using connected apps. Set ChatGPT to always ask, ask before making changes, or only ask before important changes. Manage preferences in Settings \u003e Apps.\",\"App permission controls\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7101},[7102,7103,7104,7105],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7112,\"_286\":7113},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7111,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7106,\"_274\":7107},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://chatgpt.com/football\",[7108],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7109,\"_286\":7110},\"chatgpt.com/football\",[4475],\": ChatGPT can now help you follow the tournament in a more conversational way. Ask about schedules, matchups, teams and players, country storylines, predictions, and what different match outcomes mean. Get started at \",\"World Cup updates\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7115},[7116,7117],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7119,\"_286\":7120},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7118,\"_286\":-7},\": ChatGPT can now include text and audio pronunciation guidance for words in more than 60 languages. Ask how to pronounce a word and ChatGPT can explain it with both audio and text in the conversation.\",\"Help with pronunciations\",[591],[7122],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5012,\"_286\":-7},[7124],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7125,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT now has more ways to help with common questions, from pronunciation guidance to World Cup updates. It’s also smoother to use, with easier chat organization and sharing, more control over connected apps, and faster photo uploads on iOS, and more.\",[7127],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6636,\"_286\":7128},[591],[7130],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7131,\"_286\":-7},\"June 18, 2026\",[7133,7134,7135],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7167},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7163},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7136},[7137,7138,7139,7140,7141,7142,7143,7144,7145,7146,7147,7148,7149],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5751,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7161,\"_286\":7162},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7160,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7158,\"_286\":7159},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5741,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5739,\"_286\":7157},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7156,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5736,\"_286\":7155},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7154,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7152,\"_286\":7153},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1953,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5745,\"_286\":7151},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7150,\"_286\":-7},\" users. Previously if you sent more than 5k characters it was sent as an attachment. The threshold has now also been raised to 10k characters.\",[591],\"ChatGPT Plus, Pro,\",[591],\" to convert the attachment back to a direct paste.\\n\\nThis is already available to \",[591],\" instead of inserting it directly into the text field. This keeps the composer cleaner and helps prevent large pastes from consuming your entire context window.\\n\\nYou can still move the content back into the message at any time by clicking on \",[591],\"more than 10k characters\",[591],\" users, long pastes are handled differently in ChatGPT.\\n\\nIf you paste \",\"ChatGPT Free and Go\",[591],[7164],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7165,\"_286\":7166},\"Large pastes are now handled as attachments for more plans\",[591],[7168],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7169,\"_286\":-7},\"June 22, 2026\",[7171,7172,7173],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7182},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7179},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7174},[7175,7176],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7178,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7177,\"_286\":-7},\"\\n\\nThe model is better at identifying the underlying goal behind a question and carrying context across multiple turns. It also follows complex instructions more reliably: when a request includes several constraints or requirements, responses are more likely to address all of them and clearly explain why a recommendation is a good fit.\\n\\nWhen users add constraints, clarify what they mean, or push back on an answer, the model should adapt more effectively instead of repeating its original approach.\\n\\nShopping and local business queries should also feel more useful. The model makes better use of location context to surface relevant nearby options and can bring together product recommendations, business information, and images more coherently when those elements are helpful.\\n\\nOverall, responses should feel more tasteful and cohesive. Formatting is less templated and more intentionally designed, with greater creativity alongside better restraint.\",\"We’re updating GPT-5.5 Instant, our most-used model in ChatGPT, to improve conversational quality—especially when users are making a decision, asking for advice, planning something, researching options, or shopping.\",[7180],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6372,\"_286\":7181},[591],[7183],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7184,\"_286\":-7},\"June 24, 2026\",[7186,7187,7188],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7211},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7207},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7189},[7190,7191,7192,7193,7194],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7206,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7201,\"_274\":7202},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7200,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7195,\"_274\":7196},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/11369540\",[7197],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7198,\"_286\":7199},\"Learn more about using Codex with a ChatGPT plan\",[4475],\" lets Codex provision a DigitalOcean Droplet, configure SSH access, and connect it to the Codex app as a remote workspace. Users should update the ChatGPT mobile app and Codex app to the latest versions before connecting. \",\"https://chatgpt.com/plugins/share/5dc672c7116c44ff92595d48e72df522\",[7203],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7204,\"_286\":7205},\"DigitalOcean Droplet Workspace plugin\",[4475],\"Codex Remote is now generally available on all ChatGPT plans. From the ChatGPT mobile app, users can start or continue work on a connected Mac or Windows host, review progress, and approve actions from their phone. Remote Control now uses authenticated one-to-one QR pairing between each supported mobile device and each host. Connections used since June 8 remain paired; older inactive connections need to pair again. Signing out turns off Remote Control without removing existing pairings.\\n\\nThe new \",[7208],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7209,\"_286\":7210},\"Codex Remote GA and DigitalOcean plugin\",[591],[7212],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7213,\"_286\":7214},\"June 25, 2026\",[591],[7216,7217,7218,7219,7220,7221,7222],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7244},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7240},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7237},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7233},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7230},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7226},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7223},[7224],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7225,\"_286\":-7},\"As of June 26, 2026, GPT-4.5 is no longer available in ChatGPT, including for custom GPTs. Existing conversations that used GPT-4.5 can continue with GPT-5.5.\\n\\nThis retirement was previously announced on May 28, 2026. It applies to ChatGPT only; there are no changes to the API.\",[7227],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7228,\"_286\":7229},\"Retiring GPT-4.5\",[591],[7231],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7232,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re rolling out a new speech-to-text model for dictation in ChatGPT across all plans. This is a behind-the-scenes update, so there are no changes to how you use dictation.\\n\\nThe update improves transcription accuracy across languages and accents, including when multilingual speakers mix or switch between languages. Evaluations showed gains in Japanese, Korean, Chinese, Urdu, Vietnamese, accented English, and long-form Spanish, French, Italian, and Portuguese.\\n\\nDictation is also more robust in noisy public spaces and workplace environments, with quiet or whispered speech, and when transcribing combinations of letters and numbers.\\n\\nIn our ChatGPT dictation evaluations, word error rate—a standard measure of transcription accuracy—was at least 10% lower for top languages tested than with the previous production model.\",[7234],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7235,\"_286\":7236},\"Improved dictation in ChatGPT\",[591],[7238],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7239,\"_286\":-7},\"The personal finance experience in ChatGPT is rolling out to Plus users in the U.S. on web and iOS. It is also now available on Android for Pro and Plus users in the U.S.\\n\\nEligible users can securely connect supported financial accounts, view a dashboard of their finances, and ask ChatGPT questions grounded in their financial context\",[7241],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7242,\"_286\":7243},\"Personal finance in ChatGPT expands to Plus users and Android\",[591],[7245],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7246,\"_286\":-7},\"June 26, 2026\",[7248,7249,7250,7251,7252],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7272},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7268},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7265},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7262},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7253},[7254,7255,7256],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7261,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7257,\"_274\":7258},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001242\",[7259],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7260,\"_286\":-7},\"Learn more about ChatGPT for PowerPoint\",\"ChatGPT for PowerPoint is now generally available globally. From a sidebar in Microsoft PowerPoint, you can create new slides and decks, revise existing presentations, ask questions about a deck’s story and structure, and use Skills and apps to work with repeatable workflows and connected sources. Slides remain editable in PowerPoint, although advanced edits and template matching may still require review.\\n\\nThe add-in is available to Free, Go, Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise, ChatGPT Edu, and K-12 users, subject to plan limits and workspace settings. Install it from Microsoft Marketplace, sign in with your eligible ChatGPT account, and review important claims, numbers, and slide changes before sharing. \",[7263],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7264,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT for PowerPoint is now generally available\",[7266],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7267,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re rolling out GPT-5.5 Instant Mini in ChatGPT. It replaces GPT-5.3 Instant Mini as the fallback model users reach after hitting their GPT-5.5 Instant or Auto rate limits. Because it serves as a fallback, it won’t appear in the model picker. This update does not affect the API or Codex.\\n\\nCompared with GPT-5.3 Instant Mini, GPT-5.5 Instant Mini better tracks evolving user intent, calibrates tone, and avoids repetitive or overly structured responses. Testing also showed stronger personalization and fewer factual issues.\",[7269],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7270,\"_286\":7271},\"GPT-5.5 Instant Mini in ChatGPT\",[591],[7273],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7274,\"_286\":7275},\"July 6, 2026\",[591],[7277,7278,7279],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7287},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7283},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7280},[7281],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7282,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re rolling out a new ChatGPT Voice experience. ChatGPT Voice is now powered by GPT-Live-1 for paid users and GPT-Live-1 mini for Free users. Both models can listen and speak at the same time, making turn-taking and interruptions feel more natural.\\n\\nGPT-Live-1 works inside a ChatGPT chat, with spoken responses appearing alongside streamed text. It can use web search and memory, show visual results through supported widgets, and work with text and images in the same conversation.\\n\\nGPT-Live-1 is rolling out across consumer plans, including Free, on chatgpt.com and the ChatGPT iOS and Android apps in supported regions. It is not available in ChatGPT Business, Enterprise, or Edu workspaces at launch. GPT-Live-1 does not support video or screen sharing at this time; eligible subscribers can continue using those capabilities with Advanced Voice Mode.\",[7284],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7285,\"_286\":7286},\"Introducing GPT-Live-1 in ChatGPT Voice\",[591],[7288],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7289,\"_286\":7290},\"July 8, 2026\",[591],[7292,7293,7294,7295,7296,7297,7298,7299,7300,7301,7302,7303,7304,7305,7306,7307,7308,7309,7310,7311,7312,7313,7314,7315,7316,7317,7318],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7427},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7423},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7420},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7417},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7414},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7411},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7408},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7399},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7392},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7388},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7385},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7381},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7378},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7375},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7372},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7365},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7361},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7358},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7355},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7352},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7349},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7342},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7338},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7335},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7332},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7328},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7319},[7320,7321,7322],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7327,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7323,\"_274\":7324},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001371\",[7325],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7326,\"_286\":-7},\"Help Center article\",\"We’re deprecating Atlas as we bring browser-based agentic capabilities into ChatGPT and Codex. Atlas is scheduled to stop working on August 9, 2026.\\n\\nWe want to make this transition as easy as possible. Before then, move any Atlas data you want to keep. Atlas browser data, including bookmarks, open tabs, and browser history, will not transfer automatically. You can export your cookies and passwords to the ChatGPT desktop app and your bookmarks to Chrome. Be sure to save any important pages or URLs from your open tabs and browser history before August 9.\\n\\nYour ChatGPT conversation history is separate and will remain available in ChatGPT, subject to your plan, workspace settings, and account access.\\n\\nWe’re building on what we learned from Atlas to bring a more capable browser experience to ChatGPT, including multiple tabs, downloads, improved navigation, and account login support where available. For deeper browser-based agentic work, try the ChatGPT desktop app. For help while browsing in Chrome, try the ChatGPT Chrome extension or sidebar, where available.\\n\\nYou can learn more about moving off Atlas in our \",[7329],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7330,\"_286\":7331},\"Retiring Atlas\",[591],[7333],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7334,\"_286\":-7},\"Existing group chats will remain available and can continue to be used for now. When an existing group chat becomes read-only, users will retain access to the messages, files, and images already shared there. Individual ChatGPT conversations are unaffected.\",[7336],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7337,\"_286\":-7},\"Beginning July 9, users on web, iOS, and Android will no longer be able to create new group chats, turn existing conversations into group chats, or join a group chat through an invite link.\",[7339],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7340,\"_286\":7341},\"Retiring group chats in ChatGPT\",[591],[7343],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7344,\"_274\":7345},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001339\",[7346],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7347,\"_286\":7348},\"Learn more about creating and managing ChatGPT Sites.\",[4475],[7350],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7351,\"_286\":-7},\"In Enterprise workspaces, public publishing is off by default and must be enabled by an admin. Sites is also rolling out in public beta to Pro, Pro Lite, and Edu users, with Plus users following over the coming days. Sites is not available on Free or Go plans. Public publishing and the expanded beta rollout are not available in the EEA, Switzerland, or the United Kingdom at launch.\",[7353],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7354,\"_286\":-7},\"To create a Site, start in ChatGPT Work on the web or in Work or Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app. Describe what you want to build, add any relevant content, files, data, links, or constraints, and review the private preview before publishing.\",[7356],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7357,\"_286\":-7},\"Business and Enterprise customers already have access to Sites. Starting today, they can also publish Sites publicly and share them with anyone through a URL, expanding Sites beyond people in their workspace.\",[7359],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7360,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Sites lets you turn your work or ideas into an interactive website or lightweight app without leaving ChatGPT. You can create dashboards, project trackers, launch calendars, prototypes, internal portals, and reports, then preview and refine the result with ChatGPT before sharing it.\",[7362],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7363,\"_286\":7364},\"Introducing ChatGPT Sites in public beta\",[591],[7366],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7367,\"_274\":7368},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001276\",[7369],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7370,\"_286\":7371},\"Learn more about moving to the new ChatGPT desktop app.\",[4475],[7373],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7374,\"_286\":-7},\"If you already use the Codex app, update it as usual to move to the new ChatGPT desktop app. If you use the previous ChatGPT desktop app, follow the prompt in the app to download the new version. The previous app may remain installed as ChatGPT Classic. ChatGPT Classic continues to receive model updates, bug fixes, security patches, and support for its existing Enterprise capabilities, while new agent features such as Work and Codex are available in the new app.\",[7376],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7377,\"_286\":-7},\"On desktop, Work can use local files and desktop apps with your permission. The built-in browser lets ChatGPT gather information from websites and work with supported web-based tools and files. Codex also adds inline editing within diffs, pull-request review in the side panel, faster computer use, and support for multiple repositories in one project.\",[7379],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7380,\"_286\":-7},\"The new ChatGPT desktop app is available globally for macOS and Windows. It combines Chat for questions and conversation, Work for research and finished deliverables, and Codex for software development in one app.\",[7382],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7383,\"_286\":7384},\"The new ChatGPT desktop app brings Chat, Work, and Codex together\",[591],[7386],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7387,\"_286\":-7},\"Enterprise and Edu users can find skills under Plugins in the sidebar, on the Skills tab in the Plugin Directory.\",[7389],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7390,\"_286\":7391},\"Skills are now generally available\",[591],[7393],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7394,\"_274\":7395},\"/en/articles/20001256-plugins-in-chatgpt-and-codex\",[7396],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7397,\"_286\":7398},\"Learn more about plugins and the new plugin directory.\",[4475],[7400,7401],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7403,\"_274\":7404},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":7402},[4475],\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001275\",[7405],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7406,\"_286\":7407},\"Learn more about ChatGPT Work and Codex\",[4475],[7409],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7410,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re also replacing the App Directory with the Plugin Directory. Existing app connections are unaffected. Plugins can package skills, apps, and app templates for specific workflows, and are available from ChatGPT on web and desktop, including Work and Codex.\",[7412],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7413,\"_286\":-7},\"On web and mobile, Enterprise and Edu workspaces have a two-week preview period. Work is off by default during the preview, and admins can opt out before it turns on automatically at the end of the preview.\",[7415],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7416,\"_286\":-7},\"On web and mobile, Work is rolling out to paid plans except Free and Go. Pro, Pro Lite, Enterprise, and Edu users receive access first; Plus and Business users will follow over the coming days. Work is available in all supported regions.\",[7418],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7419,\"_286\":-7},\"Work can also keep projects moving through Scheduled Tasks that run once, repeat on a schedule or trigger, or monitor for changes.\",[7421],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7422,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Work is an agent for longer, more involved tasks. It can research and analyze information, work across connected apps and files, and create finished documents, spreadsheets, presentations, reports, and Sites. You can follow its progress, answer questions, change direction, and approve important actions as it works.\",[7424],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7425,\"_286\":7426},\"Introducing ChatGPT Work\",[591],[7428],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7429,\"_286\":7430},\"July 9, 2026\",[591],[7432,7433,7434],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7441},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7438},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7435},[7436],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7437,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT is available again on WhatsApp in the European Economic Area (EEA). You can get started without a ChatGPT account by messaging the verified 1-800-CHATGPT contact at +1-800-242-8478.\\n\\nOn WhatsApp, you can message ChatGPT, upload images, send voice notes, create images, and use ChatGPT in many languages. Linking your ChatGPT account is optional and provides higher usage limits.\\n\\nAvailability is based on the country code associated with your WhatsApp number and may roll out gradually. Usage limits apply.\\n\\nChatGPT is also available on Kakao in South Korea and Viber in supported markets.\",[7439],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7440,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT returns to WhatsApp in the EEA\",[7442],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7443,\"_286\":7444},\"July 13, 2026\",[591],[7446,7447,7448],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7455},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7452},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7449},[7450],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7451,\"_286\":-7},\"We’ve rolled out a new way to search your chats, projects, images, and documents in ChatGPT on web, iOS, and Android. You can quickly find past chats, projects, images, and documents from one place.\\n\\nStart searching from the ChatGPT sidebar to find what you need across everything, or use filters to narrow results by content type. Select a result to open the chat, project, or file directly in ChatGPT.\\n\\nAvailable on all ChatGPT plans globally.\",[7453],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7454,\"_286\":-7},\"Search across chats, projects, and files is now supercharged.\",[7456],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7457,\"_286\":7458},\"July 14, 2026\",[591],[7460,7461,7462],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7470},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7466},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7463},[7464],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7465,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re increasing the character limit for custom instructions in ChatGPT. Plus, Pro, Enterprise, Business, and Education users can now save up to 5,000 characters, up from 1,500, giving them more room to customize ChatGPT’s response style and behavior.\",[7467],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7468,\"_286\":7469},\"Increased custom instructions limit\",[591],[7471],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7472,\"_286\":7473},\"July 15, 2026\",[591],[7475,7476,7477,7478,7479],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7532},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7528},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7525},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7521},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7480},[7481,7482,7483,7484,7485],[7514],[7507],[7500],[7493],[7486],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7487},[7488,7489],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7491,\"_286\":7492},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7490,\"_286\":-7},\" As part of this update, Codex remains a separate view, and its workflows and history are unchanged. Quick Chats remain available for fast conversations.\",\"Codex remains unchanged:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7494},[7495,7496],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7498,\"_286\":7499},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7497,\"_286\":-7},\" Cloud Work conversations now sync across web, mobile, and desktop, so you can start on one surface and continue on another. Local conversations stay on your computer.\",\"Continue Work across devices:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7501},[7502,7503],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7505,\"_286\":7506},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7504,\"_286\":-7},\" Your existing ChatGPT Projects now appear in the app. You can start a Chat conversation inside a Project or begin a Work thread using Project context.\",\"Projects in the desktop app:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7508},[7509,7510],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7512,\"_286\":7513},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7511,\"_286\":-7},\" Chat and Work conversations now appear together in Recents, where you can sort, filter, and pin them.\",\"Unified Recents:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7515},[7516,7517],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7519,\"_286\":7520},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7518,\"_286\":-7},\" A global switcher lets you choose between ChatGPT and Codex. In ChatGPT, choose Chat for quick questions and conversational help, or Work to complete tasks end to end.\",\"A clearer desktop layout:\",[591],[7522],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7523,\"_286\":7524},\"macOS and Windows\",[591],[7526],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7527,\"_286\":-7},\"We’ve updated the ChatGPT desktop app to make it easier to choose between Chat and Work, find your conversations and Projects, and continue Work across devices. These updates are now live for all plans on macOS and Windows.\",[7529],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7530,\"_286\":7531},\"ChatGPT desktop app experience updates\",[591],[7533],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7534,\"_286\":7535},\"July 16, 2026\",[591],[7537,7538,7539,7540,7541,7542,7543,7544,7545,7546],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7599},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7596},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7593},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7590},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7587},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7584},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7568},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7564},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7561},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7547},[7548,7549,7550,7551,7552],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7557,\"_274\":7558},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1953,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7553,\"_274\":7554},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/pricing#chatgpt-voice-in-desktop\",[7555],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7556,\"_286\":-7},\"pricing and limits\",\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/features/voice\",[7559],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7560,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Voice\",[7562],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7563,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Voice is now available in Work and Codex in the ChatGPT desktop app. Start a new task in Voice to speak naturally, interrupt, and ask Voice to start or coordinate work using the tools and permissions available to the selected experience.\",[7565],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7566,\"_286\":7567},\"ChatGPT Voice in Work and Codex on desktop\",[591],[7569,7570,7571,7572,7573],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7583,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7579,\"_274\":7580},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7578,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7574,\"_274\":7575},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://openai.com/index/health-in-chatgpt/\",[7576],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7577,\"_286\":-7},\"Launching Health in ChatGPT\",\"and our blog \",\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001036\",[7581],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7582,\"_286\":-7},\"Health in ChatGPT \",\"Learn more in our help article \",[7585],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7586,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Health is designed to support, not replace, medical care and is not intended for diagnosis or treatment. \",[7588],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7589,\"_286\":-7},\"Health is built with layered privacy and security safeguards. Connected medical records and Apple Health information, and conversations that use it, are not used to train our foundation models or target ads.\",[7591],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7592,\"_286\":-7},\"Available on web and iOS, Health lets you view lab results, medications, activity, sleep, and other health information in one place. You can ask questions directly in ChatGPT or use the Health tab to explore trends, prepare for appointments, understand test results, track wellness goals, and think through questions to discuss with a healthcare professional. The experience builds on feedback from early testers and gives you control over what you connect and when ChatGPT can use it.\",[7594],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7595,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re starting to roll out a new health experience in ChatGPT. Logged-in Free, Go, Plus, and Pro users in the United States who are 18 or older can securely connect supported health records and Apple Health data, see a dashboard of their health information, and ask questions grounded in their personal health context. \",[7597],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":4733,\"_286\":7598},[591],[7600],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7601,\"_286\":-7},\"July 23, 2026\",[7603,7604,7605,7606,7607],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7625},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7623},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7614},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7611},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7608},[7609],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7610,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re beginning to roll out Sign in with ChatGPT across select plugins and partner sites, starting with Airtable, GitLab, HubSpot, Notion, Supabase, and Vercel.\\n\\nWhen you connect a supported app from the plugin directory ChatGPT, you can use Sign in with ChatGPT to create or link an account with that service in fewer steps. On participating partner sites, you can also choose ‘Sign in with ChatGPT’ to create or access your account.\\n\\nThis means less time on account setup and an easier way to start working with these tools from ChatGPT and Codex.\\n\\nWhen you sign in, only your name, email, and profile picture (if you have one) are shared with the partner. You’ll still separately review and approve the access each plugin receives.\",[7612],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7613,\"_286\":-7},\"Sign in with ChatGPT\",[7615,7616,7617],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7622,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7618,\"_274\":7619},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001406\",[7620],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7621,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT for Academic Researchers\",\"Research rarely happens alone. ChatGPT for Academic Researchers gives faculty and postdoctoral researchers the ability to apply for 12 months of complimentary access to a dedicated ChatGPT workspace for a small, verified team. Each workspace supports up to five members and includes business data protections and ChatGPT Pro-level usage limits, helping researchers collaborate while keeping team research in its own workspace.\\n\\nTo apply, researchers sign in with an institutional email, verify their affiliation through SheerID, and share a qualifying paper and a short description of their intended research use. Approved applicants complete a $0 checkout with a valid card, create the workspace, and can invite up to four verified collaborators from the same institution. Researchers at existing ChatGPT Edu institutions can still apply, but when approved, follow an institution-managed Edu route instead. The program covers ChatGPT access, not API credits.\\n\\nRead the full eligibility and program details in \",[7624],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7621,\"_286\":-7},[7626],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7627,\"_286\":-7},\"July 29, 2026\",[7629,7630,7631],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7645},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7641},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7632},[7633,7634,7635],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7640,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7636,\"_274\":7637},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"/en/articles/11084440-images-in-chatgpt\",[7638],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7639,\"_286\":-7},\"Images in ChatGPT\",\"On August 30, 2026, we’re retiring the official DALL·E GPT in ChatGPT. We encourage you to download any images you want to keep before then.\\n\\nTo continue creating or editing images, use ChatGPT Images. User-created GPTs with image generation enabled are not affected.\\n\\nLearn more in \",[7642],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7643,\"_286\":7644},\"Retiring the DALL·E GPT\",[591],[7646],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7647,\"_286\":-7},\"July 31, 2026\",[7649,7650,7651,7652,7653,7654,7655,7656,7657,7658,7659],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7732},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7728},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7721},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7711},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7705},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7702},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7698},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7695},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7670},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7667},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7660},[7661,7662],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7663,\"_274\":7664},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://openai.com/index/learn-teach-chatgpt-work-codex/\",[7665],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7666,\"_286\":-7},\"Learn more about the new education plugins\",[7668],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7669,\"_286\":-7},\"The plugins are available through ChatGPT Edu and ChatGPT for Teachers district deployments. Schools and institutions control which tools and permissions are available.\",[7671,7672,7673],[7688],[7681],[7674],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7675},[7676,7677],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7679,\"_286\":7680},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7678,\"_286\":-7},\" Plan lessons, create classroom resources, adapt materials for different learners, and develop interactive visuals.\",\"K–12 Educator:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7682},[7683,7684],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7686,\"_286\":7687},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7685,\"_286\":-7},\" Develop syllabi, course materials, assessments, and interactive learning resources, including content for a learning management system.\",\"College Educator:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7689},[7690,7691],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7693,\"_286\":7694},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7692,\"_286\":-7},\" Create study guides, practice quizzes, flashcards, and interactive explanations using the materials you’re already studying.\",\"College Student:\",[591],[7696],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7697,\"_286\":-7},\"Three new plugins for ChatGPT Work and Codex help students and educators work with their own course materials, connected tools, and institution-approved apps.\",[7699],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7700,\"_286\":7701},\"New education plugins for students and educators\",[591],[7703],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7704,\"_286\":-7},\"This is already available to users on all other plans.\",[7706,7707,7708],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7710,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5736,\"_286\":7709},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5735,\"_286\":-7},[591],\"You can still move the content back into the message at any time by clicking on \",[7712,7713,7714,7715,7716],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7720,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7158,\"_286\":7719},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5741,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5739,\"_286\":7718},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7717,\"_286\":-7},\" instead of inserting it directly into the text field. This keeps the composer cleaner and helps prevent large pastes from consuming your entire context window.\",[591],[591],\"If you paste \",[7722,7723,7724],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5751,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7726,\"_286\":7727},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7725,\"_286\":-7},\" users, long pastes are handled differently in ChatGPT.\",\"ChatGPT Enterprise and Education\",[591],[7729],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7730,\"_286\":7731},\"Large pastes are now handled as attachments for all plans\",[591],[7733],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7734,\"_286\":7735},\"August 4, 2026\",[591],[7737,7738,7739,7740,7741],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7755},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7751},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7748},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7745},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7742},[7743],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7744,\"_286\":-7},\"This release applies to the chat experience in ChatGPT. Work and Codex are not changing as part of this release.\",[7746],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7747,\"_286\":-7},\"GPT‑5.6 Luna will become the default model for Free and Go users this week. Starting next week, they’ll also have unlimited text chats and access to a new Think button for harder questions (subject to abuse guardrails). Limits will still apply for file uploads, images and other tools.\",[7749],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7750,\"_286\":-7},\"Plus and Pro users can now use an updated GPT‑5.6 Sol in ChatGPT with more reliable facts, more focused answers, and a new slider to choose how much thought ChatGPT puts into a response.\",[7752],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7753,\"_286\":7754},\"Updates to GPT‑5.6 in ChatGPT\",[591],[7756],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7757,\"_286\":7758},\"August 6, 2026\",[591],[7760,7761,7762,7763,7764,7765,7766,7767,7768,7769,7770,7771,7772,7773,7774],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7912},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7909},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7906},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7903},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7849},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7845},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7832},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7829},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7812},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7809},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7800},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7796},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":7787},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7784},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7775},[7776,7777,7778],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7783,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7779,\"_274\":7780},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"/en/articles/20001274\",[7781],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7782,\"_286\":-7},\"Learn more about ChatGPT Voice\",\"GPT-Live in ChatGPT Voice now supports file uploads and Projects. You can now upload files in a voice conversation and analyze its contents or ask questions. You can also use voice in Projects, referencing recent project chats, sources, and project instructions.\\n\\n\",[7785],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7786,\"_286\":-7},\"Files and Projects in ChatGPT Voice\",[7788],[7789],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7790},[7791,7792],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7794,\"_286\":7795},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7793,\"_286\":-7},\" Eligible users on personal plans and ChatGPT Business can see their remaining Work usage in the sidebar. Available credit options depend on your account and workspace permissions.\",\"See your Work usage at a glance.\",[591],[7797],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7798,\"_286\":7799},\"ChatGPT Work on the web\",[591],[7801],[7802],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7803},[7804,7805],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7807,\"_286\":7808},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7806,\"_286\":-7},\" Improved connection times make it quicker to begin a Voice conversation with ChatGPT.\",\"Start Voice conversations faster.\",[591],[7810],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1716,\"_286\":7811},[591],[7813,7814],[7822],[7815],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7816},[7817,7818],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7820,\"_286\":7821},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7819,\"_286\":-7},\" When you return to a conversation, completed answers now appear without slowly replaying as though they’re still being generated.\",\"Pick up completed answers without the replay.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7823},[7824,7825],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7827,\"_286\":7828},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7826,\"_286\":-7},\" If dictation fails because of a connection issue or timeout, ChatGPT automatically retries once, helping you finish recording without starting over.\",\"Dictate with fewer interruptions.\",[591],[7830],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1745,\"_286\":7831},[591],[7833],[7834],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7835},[7836,7837,7838,7839],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7843,\"_286\":7844},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7842,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7840,\"_286\":7841},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"Settings → Voice\",[591],\". On mobile, ChatGPT can recognize when a background Voice conversation no longer seems active, check whether you’re still there, and end the session if you don’t respond. You can turn off Background conversations at any time in \",\"Safeguards for background Voice conversations\",[591],[7846],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7847,\"_286\":7848},\"iOS and Android\",[591],[7850,7851,7852,7853,7854,7855],[7896],[7884],[7877],[7870],[7863],[7856],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7857},[7858,7859],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7861,\"_286\":7862},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7860,\"_286\":-7},\" The signed-out experience on the web now includes a cleaner, unified composer menu.\",\"Use an updated composer when signed out.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7864},[7865,7866],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7868,\"_286\":7869},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7867,\"_286\":-7},\" ChatGPT makes better use of information in attached files when you ask it to summarize a document, find specific details, review material, or draft from a source.\",\"Get answers that stay closer to your documents.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7871},[7872,7873],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7875,\"_286\":7876},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7874,\"_286\":-7},\" Search now includes folders and matches conversation titles across web, iOS, and Android. On the web, you can also search within Library to find your saved files.\",\"Find folders, files, and past conversations faster.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7878},[7879,7880],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7882,\"_286\":7883},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7881,\"_286\":-7},\" On the web, drag across multiple files or folders to select them together.\",\"Select several Library items at once.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7885},[7886,7887,7888,7889],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7894,\"_286\":7895},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7893,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7891,\"_286\":7892},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7890,\"_286\":-7},\", and choose a file you’ve already saved.\",\"Add from library\",[591],\" Open the composer menu on the web, select \",\"Add saved files without uploading them again.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7897},[7898,7899],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7901,\"_286\":7902},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7900,\"_286\":-7},\" On the web, text copied from Google Docs or another ChatGPT conversation keeps its headings, bold text, links, and lists, both while you’re writing and after you send your message.\",\"Keep your formatting when you paste.\",[591],[7904],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7905,\"_286\":-7},\"Writing, files, and search\",[7907],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7908,\"_286\":-7},\"We’ve made it easier to bring documents and saved files into your conversations, find what you need, and pick up where you left off.\",[7910],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6636,\"_286\":7911},[591],[7913],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7914,\"_286\":7915},\"August 7, 2026\",[591],[7917,7918,7919],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7927},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7923},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7920},[7921],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7922,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT can now help you find available restaurant reservations with OpenTable, Resy, and Yelp.\\n\\nAsk in the chat and include where and when you’d like to eat, your party size, and any preferences, such as cuisine, budget, dietary needs, or atmosphere. You’ll see available reservation times directly in the response. You can also ask follow-up questions to narrow your options or check a specific restaurant. When you find a time that works, select it to book it.\\n\\nRolling out across all ChatGPT plans on mobile, web, and desktop. Reservations are available globally with OpenTable and in the US with Resy and in the US and Canada with Yelp. ChatGPT Work does not include restaurant reservation search.\",[7924],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7925,\"_286\":7926},\"Restaurant reservations in ChatGPT\",[591],[7928],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7929,\"_286\":7930},\"August 10, 2026\",[591],[7932,7933,7934,7935,7936,7937,7938,7939,7940],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7967},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7963},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7960},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7957},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7954},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7951},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7948},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":7944},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7941},[7942],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7943,\"_286\":-7},\"Computer History is an optional feature in the ChatGPT macOS app that lets ChatGPT and Codex reference selected activity from apps and websites, helping users continue work without re-explaining every detail. It records interaction events—not screenshots, screen recordings, microphone input, or system audio—and private browsing is not included.\\n\\nComputer History is off by default and available to Pro, Business, and Enterprise users. Business and Enterprise admins must grant access before members can opt in. Users can pause Computer History, choose included apps and sites, and inspect or delete timeline items. Note that Computer History is not currently available in the EEA, UK or Switzerland.\",[7945],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7946,\"_286\":7947},\"Computer History for macOS\",[591],[7949],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7950,\"_286\":-7},\"Rolling out to Plus, Pro, Enterprise, Edu, Healthcare and Business users on the web in both the Chat and Work toggles. Mobile support will follow.  \",[7952],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7953,\"_286\":-7},\"The initial experience includes My Drive and files and folders shared directly with you; Shared Drives aren’t included yet. Some Google Drive editing and collaboration features aren’t yet available in ChatGPT.\",[7955],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6657,\"_286\":7956},[591],[7958],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7959,\"_286\":-7},\"When you’re working with a file, you can now keep Google Docs, Sheets, and Slides open beside the conversation while asking ChatGPT to summarize, analyze, compare, or create something new from them. You can also select a folder and ask ChatGPT to work across the files it contains. Your content stays connected to Drive, so it’s easy to return to the original. Where supported and authorized, ChatGPT can update the source file directly.\",[7961],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7962,\"_286\":-7},\"If you have the Google Drive plugin connected, you can now see and browse your Google Drive files and folders directly from Library, including items shared directly with you. You can also quickly pull up a Drive file from the composer or with @mentions and add it to any chat—without uploading it again.\",[7964],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7965,\"_286\":7966},\"Google Drive is now in Library\",[591],[7968],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7969,\"_286\":7970},\"August 13, 2026\",[591],[7972,7973,7974,7975,7976,7977,7978,7979,7980,7981,7982,7983,7984,7985,7986,7987,7988],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8112},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8109},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8106},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8102},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8077},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8074},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8065},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8062},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8037},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8033},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8016},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8008},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8004},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8001},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7998},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7995},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":7989},[7990,7991,7992],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":3198,\"_274\":7993},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[7994],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1546,\"_286\":-7},[7996],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7997,\"_286\":-7},\"This update is available on all ChatGPT plans. Shared projects continue to use project-only memory and cannot be switched to default memory. ChatGPT Work is not available in projects using project-only memory.\",[7999],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8000,\"_286\":-7},\"With project-only memory, ChatGPT can use conversations from the same project for context, but it won’t reference memories or conversations from outside the project. Information from the project is also kept out of memory used in chats outside the project.Changes may take a few hours to take effect.\",[8002],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8003,\"_286\":-7},\"You can now change a project’s memory setting after you create it. Open the project, select the three-dot menu, choose Project settings, and select Default memory or Project-only memory under Memory.\",[8005],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8006,\"_286\":8007},\"Edit memory settings for existing projects\",[591],[8009,8010],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8011,\"_274\":8012},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://chatgpt.com/download/\",[8013],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8014,\"_286\":8015},\"Download ChatGPT for Linux\",[4475],[8017,8018],[8026],[8019],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8020},[8021,8022],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8024,\"_286\":8025},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8023,\"_286\":-7},\" Browser actions are available in the Linux app; controlling other desktop apps is not yet supported.\",\"Work in the built-in browser or Chrome.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8027},[8028,8029],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8031,\"_286\":8032},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8030,\"_286\":-7},\" The desktop app is now available globally in public preview on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS and 26.04 LTS, Debian 13, and Fedora 43 and 44.\",\"Use ChatGPT and Codex on Linux.\",[591],[8034],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8035,\"_286\":8036},\"Linux desktop\",[591],[8038,8039,8040],[8055],[8048],[8041],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8042},[8043,8044],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8046,\"_286\":8047},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8045,\"_286\":-7},\" Connected keyboards keep the composer focused, preventing interruptions while you write.\",\"Keep typing with a physical keyboard.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8049},[8050,8051],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8053,\"_286\":8054},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8052,\"_286\":-7},\" Composer suggestions update as you type or delete text.\",\"See suggestions that stay in sync.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8056},[8057,8058],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8060,\"_286\":8061},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8059,\"_286\":-7},\" The dictation button stays available after you add text or attachments, so you can continue building the same message.\",\"Switch between typing and dictation.\",[591],[8063],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1716,\"_286\":8064},[591],[8066],[8067],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8068},[8069,8070],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8072,\"_286\":8073},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8071,\"_286\":-7},\" Select Think on the web when you want ChatGPT to reason through a harder question.\",\"Use Think on Free and Go.\",[591],[8075],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5073,\"_286\":8076},[591],[8078,8079,8080],[8095],[8088],[8081],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8082},[8083,8084],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8086,\"_286\":8087},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8085,\"_286\":-7},\" Eligible paid users can see homepage suggestions based on their conversation history and connected tools.\",\"Get suggestions that fit how you use ChatGPT.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8089},[8090,8091],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8093,\"_286\":8094},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8092,\"_286\":-7},\" For eligible unshared projects, switch between default and project-only memory without starting a new project. Shared projects remain project-only.\",\"Change an existing project’s memory setting.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8096},[8097,8098],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8100,\"_286\":8101},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8099,\"_286\":-7},\" Ask ChatGPT to quiz you on a topic and answer questions directly in your conversation. Available to all consumer ChatGPT plans and Edu plans on web and mobile.\",\"Practice with interactive quizzes.\",[591],[8103],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8104,\"_286\":8105},\"Learning, Projects, and personalized suggestions\",[591],[8107],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8108,\"_286\":-7},\"We’ve made it easier to study with interactive quizzes, manage project memory, and move between typing, dictation, and desktop work.\",[8110],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":6636,\"_286\":8111},[591],[8113],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8114,\"_286\":8115},\"August 14, 2026\",[591],[8117,8118,8119],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8203},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8199},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8120},[8121,8122,8123,8124,8125],[8182],[8168],[8154],[8140],[8126],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8127},[8128,8129,8130,8131],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8138,\"_286\":8139},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8137,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8132,\"_274\":8133},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/projects?surface=app#app-organize-projects-and-chats\",[8134],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8135,\"_286\":8136},\"Learn more about organizing projects and chats\",[4475],\" Pinned chats now stay in sync between the ChatGPT desktop app and iOS when you use the same Codex account. Android is not included in this release. \",\"Keep pinned chats in sync.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8141},[8142,8143,8144,8145],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8152,\"_286\":8153},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8151,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8146,\"_274\":8147},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-chatgpt#share-a-read-only-snapshot-of-a-codex-thread\",[8148],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8149,\"_286\":8150},\"Learn more about sharing a Codex chat\",[4475],\" Personal share links can be opened by anyone with the link. A snapshot is static and does not include tool calls or shell input and output. Codex redacts known secret patterns, but users should review the snapshot because sensitive paths, diffs, images, or other content may remain. \",\"Share a read-only snapshot of a Codex chat.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8155},[8156,8157,8158,8159],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8166,\"_286\":8167},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8165,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8160,\"_274\":8161},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/customization/computer-history\",[8162],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8163,\"_286\":8164},\"Learn more about Computer History\",[4475],\" Computer History is now available in the EEA, Switzerland, and the United Kingdom for Pro users in the ChatGPT desktop app on macOS. It is off by default and requires Memories. \",\"Use Computer History in more regions.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8169},[8170,8171,8172,8173],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8180,\"_286\":8181},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8179,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8174,\"_274\":8175},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/plugins?surface=app#app-use-apple-messages-from-codex\",[8176],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8177,\"_286\":8178},\"Learn more about the Apple Messages plugin\",[4475],\" On Apple silicon Macs, the Apple Messages plugin in the ChatGPT desktop app can read and search iMessage, SMS, and RCS conversations and prepare or send messages through Messages. By default, ChatGPT asks the user to approve the message and recipients before sending. \",\"Use Apple Messages from Codex and ChatGPT Work.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8183},[8184,8185,8186,8187,8188,8189],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8197,\"_286\":8198},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8196,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8194,\"_286\":8195},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":4690,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7344,\"_274\":8190},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[8191],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8192,\"_286\":8193},\"Learn more about creating and managing ChatGPT Sites\",[4475],\"Change URL\",[591],\" Site owners on Plus and Pro can change an existing Site’s ChatGPT-hosted URL without redeploying it. The previous address redirects to the new URL, including routes and query parameters, while custom domains remain separate and unchanged. In the Site’s settings, select \",\"Choose a new URL for a ChatGPT Site.\",[591],[8200],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8201,\"_286\":8202},\"Codex and ChatGPT feature updates\",[591],[8204],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8205,\"_286\":8206},\"August 20, 2026\",[591],[8208,8209,8210,8211,8212,8213,8214,8215,8216,8217,8218,8219,8220,8221,8222,8223,8224,8225,8226,8227,8228,8229,8230],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8359},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8355},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8352},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8343},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8340},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8333},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8329},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8326},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8317},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8313},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8310},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8301},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8297},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8294},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8285},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8281},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8278},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8261},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8258},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8254},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8251},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8234},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8231},[8232],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8233,\"_286\":-7},\"Available in the ChatGPT app for Android, version 1.2026.216 or later.\",[8235,8236],[8244],[8237],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8238},[8239,8240],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8242,\"_286\":8243},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8241,\"_286\":-7},\" Your sidebar now shows up to eight recent conversations.\",\"Keep recent chats easier to browse.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8245},[8246,8247],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8249,\"_286\":8250},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8248,\"_286\":-7},\" Images you create in ChatGPT now fill the width of the conversation.\",\"See generated images at full width.\",[591],[8252],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8253,\"_286\":-7},\"Generated images are easier to view, and your recent conversations are easier to browse.\",[8255],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8256,\"_286\":8257},\"Updates to ChatGPT on Android\",[591],[8259],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8260,\"_286\":-7},\"Available in the ChatGPT app for iOS. Access to recent photos requires permission to access your photos.\",[8262,8263],[8271],[8264],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8265},[8266,8267],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8269,\"_286\":8270},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8268,\"_286\":-7},\" ChatGPT now tells you when it is waiting for an internet connection.\",\"See clearer connection updates.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8272},[8273,8274],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8276,\"_286\":8277},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8275,\"_286\":-7},\" Press and hold the + button to open your recent photos, then choose one to add to your conversation.\",\"Attach recent photos faster.\",[591],[8279],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8280,\"_286\":-7},\"Recent photos are easier to reach, and connection-status messages are clearer.\",[8282],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8283,\"_286\":8284},\"Updates to ChatGPT on iOS\",[591],[8286],[8287],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8288},[8289,8290],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8292,\"_286\":8293},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8291,\"_286\":-7},\" Interactive experiences now appear progressively in the conversation instead of waiting until the full experience is ready.\",\"See interactive content sooner.\",[591],[8295],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8296,\"_286\":-7},\"Interactive content generated by ChatGPT can now begin appearing while it is still being created.\",[8298],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8299,\"_286\":8300},\"Interactive content appears sooner on the web\",[591],[8302],[8303],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8304},[8305,8306],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8308,\"_286\":8309},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8307,\"_286\":-7},\" ChatGPT loads messages in smaller sections instead of retrieving the entire conversation at once.\",\"Open longer chats without the wait.\",[591],[8311],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8312,\"_286\":-7},\"Long conversations now load more efficiently in ChatGPT on the web.\",[8314],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8315,\"_286\":8316},\"Faster long conversations on the web\",[591],[8318],[8319],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8320},[8321,8322],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8324,\"_286\":8325},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8323,\"_286\":-7},\" ChatGPT can better account for your local time when responding to time-sensitive questions.\",\"Get answers that fit your time of day.\",[591],[8327],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8328,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT now has a better sense of your local time during a conversation.\",[8330],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8331,\"_286\":8332},\"More time-aware answers\",[591],[8334,8335],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7394,\"_274\":8336},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[8337],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8338,\"_286\":8339},\"Learn more about plugins in ChatGPT and Codex\",[4475],[8341],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8342,\"_286\":-7},\"Plugin availability depends on your plan, region, and workspace settings. Desktop is not included in this update.\",[8344],[8345],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8346},[8347,8348],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8350,\"_286\":8351},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8349,\"_286\":-7},\" Rankings now prioritize plugins people keep using after installation, helping relevant options surface across ChatGPT on web and mobile.\",\"Find more useful plugins.\",[591],[8353],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8354,\"_286\":-7},\"Updated plugin recommendations make it easier to find tools people continue to use.\",[8356],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8357,\"_286\":8358},\"Improved plugin discovery on web and mobile\",[591],[8360],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8361,\"_286\":8362},\"August 21, 2026\",[591],[8364,8365,8366,8367,8368,8369,8370,8371,8372,8373,8374,8375,8376,8377,8378,8379],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8450},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8447},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8444},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8441},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8438},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8435},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8432},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8429},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8420},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8416},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8413},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8410},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8407},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8386},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8383},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8380},[8381],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8382,\"_286\":-7},\"Authentication in ChatGPT Work’s browser is available for Plus and Pro plans.\",[8384],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8385,\"_286\":-7},\"You stay in control of which websites ChatGPT Work can access, and it will always ask for confirmation before consequential actions, such as completing a reservation or payment. \",[8387,8388,8389,8390],[8403],[8399],[8395],[8391],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8392},[8393],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8394,\"_286\":-7},\"Find profiles of people that fit your job description and are open to work \",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8396},[8397],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8398,\"_286\":-7},\"Check X-ray and bloodwork costs through your insurance portal \",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8400},[8401],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8402,\"_286\":-7},\"Book a DMV appointment or fill out your passport renewal forms \",{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8404},[8405],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8406,\"_286\":-7},\"Figure out utilities for a new apartment and sign up for the right plan\",[8408],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8409,\"_286\":-7},\"You can now ask ChatGPT Work to do things like:\",[8411],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8412,\"_286\":-7},\"To get started, just ask ChatGPT Work to complete your task. If a website allows authentication, ChatGPT will surface the login screen so you can securely enter your credentials. You may also need to enter a security code. Once you’re signed in, ChatGPT can continue working. Your session may remain signed in for future tasks, so you don’t have to log in again every time. ChatGPT Work’s browser supports the use of password managers for simple, safe login. ChatGPT cannot see your username or password, and they are never seen by the model or used in model training. ChatGPT does not store your username or passwords. You can delete your browsing history from all sites or one site individually at any time from Settings \u003e Cloud browser \u003e Browser data. \",[8414],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8415,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Work’s browser on web and mobile can also help you get tasks done on some websites that require you to sign in—so you can hand off a task and step away while it keeps working.\",[8417],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8418,\"_286\":8419},\"ChatGPT Work can now complete tasks on signed-in websites\",[591],[8421,8422,8423],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8428,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8424,\"_274\":8425},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/10291617\",[8426],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1561,\"_286\":8427},[4475],\"Free users can create up to three active scheduled tasks. Tasks can run once or recur no more than once per day using flexible scheduling windows. Free and Go users cannot create webhook-triggered tasks.\\n\\nFor more information, see: \",[8430],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8431,\"_286\":-7},\"Scheduled tasks for Free users\",[8433],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8434,\"_286\":-7},\"Free, Go, Plus, and Pro users can share scheduled tasks. Recipients can review and customize the instructions and, when applicable, the schedule, connect their own apps, and create an independent copy. Running a shared webhook-triggered task requires access to Work and the recipient’s own connected app.\",[8436],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8437,\"_286\":-7},\"Share scheduled tasks\",[8439],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8440,\"_286\":-7},\"Plus and Pro users can ask Work on web, iOS, and Android to respond when a new Gmail message arrives, a Slack channel receives a message, or a GitHub pull request changes. For example, ask ChatGPT to summarize an email announcing that registration has opened, or draft next steps after a client shares feedback in Slack. Add @ChatGPT to each monitored Slack channel. Actions that require approval pause until you review them.\",[8442],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8443,\"_286\":-7},\"Create webhook-triggered tasks\",[8445],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8446,\"_286\":-7},\"Scheduled tasks in ChatGPT Work can use webhooks to respond when something changes in a supported app, helping you keep work moving without repeatedly checking for updates. You can also share a task so someone else can review and customize it, connect their own apps, and schedule an independent copy.\\n\\nSupported webhooks include new Gmail messages, Slack channel messages, and GitHub pull request activity.\",[8448],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8449,\"_286\":-7},\"Scheduled tasks can respond to app updates and be shared\",[8451],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8452,\"_286\":-7},\"August 25, 2026\",[8454,8455,8456,8457,8458],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8492},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8489},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8486},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8484},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8459},[8460,8461,8462],[8477],[8470],[8463],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8464},[8465,8466],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8468,\"_286\":8469},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8467,\"_286\":-7},\"When a conversation becomes useful for the future, you can add it to your chat history. Saving converts it into a regular chat, so it then follows your account-level personalization settings and model-improvement preferences. For example, if you have memory enabled and save a temporary chat, this will become part of your chat history and can be referenced to personalized future responses. \",\"Saving a temporary chat: \",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8471},[8472,8473],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8475,\"_286\":8476},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8474,\"_286\":-7},\" By default, temporary chats are not personalized. Non-personalized temporary chats do not use memory, custom instructions, or plugins, and they do not create new memories.\",\"Non-personalized:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8478},[8479,8480],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8482,\"_286\":8483},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8481,\"_286\":-7},\": When you create a temporary chat, you can choose to have personalized responses.  Personalized temporary chats can use your memories, custom instructions, and plugins to tailor responses. They do not create new memories and remain out of your chat history unless you save them. Personalization can be set only when you start a temporary chat and cannot be changed after the conversation begins.\",\"Personalized\",[591],[8485],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":3527,\"_286\":-7},[8487],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8488,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re rolling out new controls in temporary chat. You can now choose to personalize responses in a temporary chat with memory, plugins, and custom instructions from your regular chat settings. You can also choose to save a temporary chat.\",[8490],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8491,\"_286\":-7},\"More controls in temporary chat\",[8493],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8494,\"_286\":-7},\"August 27, 2026\",[8496,8497,8498,8499],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8510},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8506},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8503},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8500},[8501],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8502,\"_286\":-7},\"Available globally on supported Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise plans across web, desktop, iOS, and Android.\",[8504],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8505,\"_286\":-7},\"You can now connect multiple accounts for Gmail, Google Calendar, and Google Contacts plugins in ChatGPT, bringing your personal and work accounts into the same conversation. Ask ChatGPT to check your calendars together when planning your day or find emails across your connected inboxes.\",[8507],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8508,\"_286\":8509},\"Connect multiple Google accounts to ChatGPT\",[591],[8511],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8512,\"_286\":-7},\"August 28, 2026\",[8514,8515,8516,8517,8518,8519,8520,8521,8522,8523,8524,8525,8526,8527,8528,8529,8530,8531,8532,8533,8534,8535],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8649},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8645},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8642},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8625},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8622},{\"_270\":30