1423-using-site-tools-in-the-chatgpt-desktop-app\",[8575],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8576,\"_286\":8577},\"Learn more about site tools\",[4475],[8579],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8580,\"_286\":-7},\"Site tools use WebMCP and require a supported account, model, and webpage. They are available in the built-in desktop browser, not through the Chrome extension. Existing website-access and sensitive-action confirmations still apply.\",[8582],[8583],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8584},[8585,8586],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8588,\"_286\":8589},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8587,\"_286\":-7},\" ChatGPT can discover tools for your task without a separate connection. Select the arrow in the address bar to see the tools a page provides.\",\"Work directly with a website’s tools.\",[591],[8591],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8592,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Work and Codex can now use tools that supported websites provide directly in the desktop app’s built-in browser.\",[8594],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8595,\"_286\":8596},\"Use website tools in the desktop browser\",[591],[8598,8599],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7779,\"_274\":8600},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[8601],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7782,\"_286\":8602},[4475],[8604],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8605,\"_286\":-7},\"To continue a Voice conversation outside ChatGPT, turn on Background conversations in Settings → Voice.\",[8607],[8608],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8609},[8610,8611],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8613,\"_286\":8614},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8612,\"_286\":-7},\" Live Activities can show content from your voice conversation while you use another app or your phone is locked.\",\"Follow along outside the app.\",[591],[8616],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8617,\"_286\":-7},\"Content from a Live voice conversation can now appear on your iPhone’s Lock Screen and, on iPhones with Dynamic Island, in the Dynamic Island.\",[8619],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8620,\"_286\":8621},\"See Live voice content on your Lock Screen\",[591],[8623],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8624,\"_286\":-7},\"Available to all ChatGPT users on mobile globally. Update the ChatGPT app to see the new experience.\",[8626,8627],[8635],[8628],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8629},[8630,8631],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8633,\"_286\":8634},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8632,\"_286\":-7},\" Download your pack or add it to iMessage or WhatsApp on supported devices.\",\"Share your stickers in messaging apps.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8636},[8637,8638],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8640,\"_286\":8641},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8639,\"_286\":-7},\" Ask ChatGPT to make a sticker pack, or choose a sticker template from the home screen or Images.\",\"Start with a prompt or template.\",[591],[8643],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8644,\"_286\":-7},\"Turn an idea or a photo into a set of stickers you can use in your messages.\",[8646],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8647,\"_286\":8648},\"Create and share personalized sticker packs\",[591],[8650],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8651,\"_286\":8652},\"August 31, 2026\",[591],[8654,8655,8656],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8683},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8679},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8657},[8658,8659,8660,8661,8662,8663,8664,8665,8666],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8678,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8673,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8677,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8675,\"_286\":8676},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8674,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8673,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8672,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8667,\"_274\":8668},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001489\",[8669],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8670,\"_286\":8671},\"Using Healthcare Public Data in ChatGPT and Codex\",[4475],\"For details, see: \",\"\\n\\n\",\", then connect the apps you want to use. These apps are read-only and do not access patient charts. Do not include protected health information in searches sent to public sources.\",\"Plugin directory\",[591],\"To get started, install the plugin from the \",\"Eligible ChatGPT for Clinicians users in the United States can now use Healthcare Public Data in ChatGPT. The plugin brings together nine apps for searching public healthcare sources, including biomedical research, clinical trials, medication information, Medicare data, and provider records.\",[8680],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8681,\"_286\":8682},\"Healthcare Public Data in ChatGPT for Clinicians\",[591],[8684],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8685,\"_286\":-7},\"September 1, 2026\",[8687,8688,8689,8690,8691,8692,8693,8694,8695,8696,8697],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8753},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8749},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8746},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8743},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8740},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8737},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8734},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8731},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8716},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8713},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8698},[8699,8700,8701,8702,8703],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8712,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8710,\"_286\":8711},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8709,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8704,\"_274\":8705},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"/en/articles/20001339\",[8706],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8707,\"_286\":8708},\"Creating and managing ChatGPT Sites\",[4475],\", enter the recipient’s email, and save their viewer access. The recipient signs in with the account that was granted access. You can review or remove viewers in the Site’s sharing controls. Learn more in \",\"Share\",[591],\"Eligible Site owners can now share a live ChatGPT Site with named people outside their workspace, without making the Site public. External viewers can use the shared Site but cannot edit or publish it.\\n\\nTo share, open the Site, select \",[8714],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8715,\"_286\":-7},\"Share Sites with people outside your workspace\",[8717,8718,8719,8720,8721],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8730,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8726,\"_274\":8727},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5749,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":8722,\"_274\":8723},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001511\",[8724],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8725,\"_286\":-7},\"OneNote Plugin\",\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001512\",[8728],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8729,\"_286\":-7},\"Zendesk Plugin\",\"Read more: \",[8732],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8733,\"_286\":-7},\"The OneNote plugin helps you find and summarize notes, gather decisions and action items, and create or update notes through supported actions in ChatGPT and Codex. \",[8735],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8736,\"_286\":-7},\"Today, we added the Zendesk and OneNote plugins in the Plugin directory. The Zendesk plugin helps teams review support tickets and customer history, find relevant knowledge, and prepare replies in ChatGPT and Codex. Members connect their own Zendesk accounts to work with the support information they can access.\",[8738],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8739,\"_286\":-7},\"Zendesk \u0026 OneNote Plugins in ChatGPT and Codex [Beta]\",[8741],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8742,\"_286\":-7},\"Astra includes additional safety monitoring to look for cases where agents may not have interpreted your instructions correctly. If a potential case is detected, the conversation may be paused or stopped as a precaution for you to review and decide how to proceed.\",[8744],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8745,\"_286\":-7},\"Access is rolling out to a limited set of organizations. Astra is not yet generally available. Broader availability is planned over the coming days.\",[8747],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8748,\"_286\":-7},\"Today we’re introducing GPT-6 Astra, with improvements in coding, research, computer use, and complex, multi-step work. Astra can create documents, spreadsheets, and presentations that follow your templates and instructions, and adapt when you add requirements or change direction.\",[8750],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8751,\"_286\":8752},\"Introducing GPT-6 Astra\",[591],[8754],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8755,\"_286\":8756},\"September 3, 2026\",[591],[8758,8759,8760,8761,8762,8763,8764],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8828},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8824},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8821},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8778},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8775},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8772},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8765},[8766,8767],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7636,\"_274\":8768},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[8769],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8770,\"_286\":8771},\"Learn more about Images in ChatGPT\",[4475],[8773],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8774,\"_286\":-7},\"Templates are not yet available in Work mode. Existing image-generation limits are unchanged.\",[8776],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8777,\"_286\":-7},\"Some users will also see animated dots and a Snake game while images are generated. The loading experience varies by platform and rollout; Snake isn’t available in Work mode.\",[8779,8780,8781,8782],[8814],[8797],[8790],[8783],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8784},[8785,8786],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8788,\"_286\":8789},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8787,\"_286\":-7},\" Share the prompt for a generated image so others can create their own version.\",\"Share a prompt.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8791},[8792,8793],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8795,\"_286\":8796},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8794,\"_286\":-7},\" On mobile, open a generated image full-screen to edit it or add comments to tell ChatGPT what you’d like to change..\",\"Edit and comment.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8798},[8799,8800,8801,8802,8803,8804],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8812,\"_286\":8813},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8811,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8809,\"_286\":8810},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8808,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8806,\"_286\":8807},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8805,\"_286\":-7},\". Draw your idea, then describe the image you want to create. \",\"Sketch\",[591],\" in the message box and select \",\"@\",[591],\" On mobile, type \",\"Turn a sketch into an image.\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8815},[8816,8817],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8819,\"_286\":8820},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8818,\"_286\":-7},\" Open Images → Templates, choose a template, and customize the details. ChatGPT may ask follow-up questions to help refine your request.\",\"Start from a template.\",[591],[8822],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8823,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Images 2.5 brings sharper details, more precise editing, and faster image generation. We’re also introducing new ways to create and share: \",[8825],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8826,\"_286\":8827},\"ChatGPT Images 2.5: new ways to create and edit\",[591],[8829],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8830,\"_286\":8831},\"September 8, 2026\",[591],[8833,8834,8835,8836,8837,8838,8839,8840,8841,8842,8843,8844,8845,8846,8847],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8951},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8947},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8944},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8941},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8920},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8917},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8914},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8906},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8902},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8899},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8896},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":8858},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":1290,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":8854},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8851},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8848},[8849],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8850,\"_286\":-7},\"If you upload a file to someone else’s shared folder and they later remove your folder access, the file stays in their folder and you lose access to it.\",[8852],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8853,\"_286\":-7},\"Files uploaded to a shared folder belong to the folder’s owner. The person who uploaded each file is still recorded.\",[8855],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8856,\"_286\":8857},\"Shared folders and ownership\",[591],[8859,8860,8861,8862],[8889],[8882],[8875],[8863],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":8864},[8865,8866,8867,8868],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8873,\"_286\":8874},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8872,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8870,\"_286\":8871},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":8869,\"