,\"_274\":9489},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9481},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9478},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9475},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9472},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9464},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9461},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9458},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9455},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9447},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9444},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9441},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9438},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9431},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9428},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9425},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9422},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9414},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9411},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9408},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9405},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9397},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9394},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9391},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9388},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9381},[9382,9383,9384],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9017,\"_274\":9385},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[9386],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9387,\"_286\":-7},\"plugins in ChatGPT and Codex\",[9389],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9390,\"_286\":-7},\"Plugins still require their applicable account connections and workspace permissions.\",[9392],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9393,\"_286\":-7},\"Plugins can now include interactive panels, sidebar views, and viewers or editors for supported file types. Work with an app alongside your conversation, select the information you want ChatGPT to use, or complete a form provided by the plugin.\",[9395],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9396,\"_286\":-7},\"Work with interactive plugin extensions\",[9398,9399,9400],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9401,\"_274\":9402},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001542\",[9403],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9404,\"_286\":-7},\"using your ChatGPT allowance in other apps\",[9406],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9407,\"_286\":-7},\"This is a limited preview with participating integrations. Using purchased credits requires a separate opt-in. A partner may still charge for its own product or services.\",[9409],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9410,\"_286\":-7},\"Eligible Plus and Pro users can authorize participating apps to use their ChatGPT model allowance without creating an API key. Choose which apps can use your allowance and set an app-specific limit. Usage counts toward your existing plan allowance; connecting an app does not add more usage.\",[9412],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9413,\"_286\":-7},\"Use your ChatGPT allowance in participating apps\",[9415,9416,9417],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9418,\"_274\":9419},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"/en/articles/11487775-connected-apps-in-chatgpt\",[9420],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9421,\"_286\":-7},\"connected apps in ChatGPT\",[9423],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9424,\"_286\":-7},\"The connected account must have access to the event and any information used by the task.\",[9426],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9427,\"_286\":-7},\"Supported plugins can use MCP events to start an automation when something changes in a connected app. Describe what you want ChatGPT to follow and what it should do with matching updates—for example, prepare a summary when new information arrives in a channel you have asked it to monitor.\",[9429],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9430,\"_286\":-7},\"Start automations from connected-app events\",[9432,9433,9434],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9435,\"_274\":9436},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001410\",[9437],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":7613,\"_286\":-7},[9439],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9440,\"_286\":-7},\"Available to signed-in ChatGPT users, subject to organization settings. Sign-in access is separate from permission to use your ChatGPT plan allowance.\",[9442],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9443,\"_286\":-7},\"You can use your ChatGPT account to sign in to participating products without creating another password. The product receives your name, email address, and profile picture if you have one. Signing in does not share your ChatGPT conversations or memory; you approve any additional access separately.\",[9445],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9446,\"_286\":-7},\"Sign in to other products with ChatGPT\",[9448,9449,9450],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9451,\"_274\":9452},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/20001539\",[9453],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9454,\"_286\":-7},\"shareable profiles\",[9456],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9457,\"_286\":-7},\"Profile sharing and the Sites showcase are available on web and desktop. In Business workspaces, administrators control whether coworkers can view workspace profiles. Enterprise access is coming later.\",[9459],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9460,\"_286\":-7},\"Your ChatGPT profile now brings together your bio, activity, and Sites you choose to showcase. Personal profiles are private by default. You can make yours public and share its link with other people signed in to ChatGPT. Shared profiles do not show conversation titles or content.\",[9462],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9463,\"_286\":-7},\"Share your profile and showcase your Sites\",[9465,9466,9467],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9468,\"_274\":9469},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/security/setup\",[9470],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9471,\"_286\":-7},\"setting up Codex Security Cloud\",[9473],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9474,\"_286\":-7},\"Access requires the applicable workspace permissions, repository setup, and billing configuration. Existing Codex Security customers opt in before paid usage. This feature provides access to Daybreak Blue models only within Codex Security Cloud.\",[9476],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9477,\"_286\":-7},\"Codex Security Cloud can scan GitHub repositories on demand or on a schedule, while ongoing checks review new commits. Codex investigates findings, removes duplicates, and prepares proposed fixes for review. Scans run in the cloud and can continue after you close your laptop.\",[9479],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9480,\"_286\":-7},\"Scan repositories with Codex Security Cloud\",[9482,9483,9484],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9485,\"_274\":9486},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/code-review\",[9487],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9488,\"_286\":-7},\"Code Review\",[9490],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9491,\"_286\":-7},\"Available through the Code Review plugin on supported desktop and web experiences. Access to a repository follows your connected account and workspace permissions.\",[9493],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9494,\"_286\":-7},\"Use Code Review in Codex to read pull-request summaries and diffs, review findings, and discuss changes. Open a pull request, inspect the changes, and ask Codex to explain a section or help address a potential issue before sharing feedback.\",[9496],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9497,\"_286\":-7},\"Review pull requests with Codex\",[9499,9500,9501],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9502,\"_274\":9503},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/9793128\",[9504],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9505,\"_286\":-7},\"Pro plans and existing subscriptions\",[9507],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9508,\"_286\":-7},\"Included usage allowances are changing. Users affected by these changes will receive an email with additional details. The monthly price remains $200.\",[9510],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9511,\"_286\":-7},\"Pro 200 is available for new subscriptions again at $200/month.\",[9513],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9514,\"_286\":-7},\"Pro 200 subscriptions\",[9516],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9517,\"_286\":-7},\"Available to eligible Pro, Business, and Enterprise users in the ChatGPT desktop app and on the web. Sharing in managed workspaces follows your organization’s settings; Enterprise sharing is an opt-in preview.\",[9519],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9520,\"_286\":-7},\"Space brings your Pages, files, and related work together in ChatGPT. Create a space for a project, add the material you need, and share it with other people so you can keep building on the same work. Space replaces Library for accounts with access; your existing Projects remain separate.\",[9522],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9523,\"_286\":-7},\"Organize your work in ChatGPT Space\",[9525,9526,9527],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9531,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9528,\"_274\":9529},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://chatgpt.com/plugins/plugin_connector_1p_27af362d1a3c8191b38ba625f489d958?open_in_app\",[9530],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2407,\"_286\":-7},\"Audio is deleted once your notes are ready and can’t be accessed or replayed. Available in beta in the ChatGPT desktop app on macOS to Pro and Business users, with Enterprise coming soon. \",[9533],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9534,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re making it easier to bring meeting context into ChatGPT so you can act on next steps faster. The Meetings plugin takes notes for you based on what’s said in the meeting and saves personalized summaries with action items in ChatGPT Space. You can keep them private or share them with your team, then ask ChatGPT to update a project plan or draft a follow-up.\",[9536],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9537,\"_286\":-7},\"Meetings plugin\",[9539,9540,9541],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9542,\"_274\":9543},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"/en/articles/20001530\",[9544],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9545,\"_286\":-7},\"getting started with your dot\",[9547],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9548,\"_286\":-7},\"For the next month, dots usage won’t count toward eligible Pro, Business, and Enterprise users’ plan allowances. After this period, we’ll share usage terms for each plan.\",[9550],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9551,\"_286\":-7},\"Dots are rolling out gradually to eligible Pro and Business Premium users aged 18 and older in supported markets. Pro access excludes the European Economic Area, Switzerland, and the UK at launch. Enterprise access is a beta and is off by default. Create your dot in the ChatGPT desktop app or on desktop web.\",[9553],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9554,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re introducing dots: always-on agents in ChatGPT that can take on ongoing work and keep making progress between conversations. Give your dot a goal, connect the apps it needs, and define what it can do on its own. Powered by GPT-6 Astra, your dot has its own cloud computer and can bring results back for your review.\",[9556],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9557,\"_286\":-7},\"Meet your dot\",[9559,9560,9561],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9565,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7403,\"_274\":9562},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[9563],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9564,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Work and Codex\",\"For availability and model selection, see: \",[9567,9568,9569,9570],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9576,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9575,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9571,\"_274\":9572},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/11750701\",[9573],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9574,\"_286\":-7},\"manage model access with role-based access control\",\"Enterprise and Edu workspace owners can enable model access in Workspace settings \u003e Permissions \u0026 roles, on the Workspace tab or through a custom role. Learn how to \",\"GPT-6.1 Sol improves on GPT-6 Sol in agentic coding, computer use, and professional work. We’re rolling it out in ChatGPT Work and Codex, starting with Pro users and expanding to Plus, Business, Enterprise, and Edu. \",[9578],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9579,\"_286\":-7},\"GPT-6.1 Sol in ChatGPT Work and Codex\",[9581,9582,9583,9584,9585],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9592,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9590,\"_286\":9591},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9589,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7344,\"_274\":9586},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[9587],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9588,\"_286\":-7},\"creating and managing Sites\",\". These updates are available where Sites is supported. Learn more about \",\"Automations\",[591],\"Site owners can also create recurring cloud schedules from \",[9594,9595,9596],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9600,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9598,\"_286\":9599},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9597,\"_286\":-7},\" from a published Site in a desktop browser to continue editing in ChatGPT, review changes, and publish when ready.\",\"Edit site\",[591],\"Site owners and editors on Plus and Pro can select \",[9602],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9603,\"_286\":-7},\"Creating, editing, and scheduling Sites\",[9605],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9606,\"_286\":-7},\"Pages follow Space’s availability and sharing settings. Sharing a Page does not give other people access to your private chats or memory; information added to the Page is visible to people who can view it.\",[9608],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9609,\"_286\":-7},\"Turn a conversation into a Page, start from a template, or begin writing directly in Space. Edit the text yourself or ask ChatGPT to revise it, add charts, or create interactive content. Collaborators can work on the same Page and leave comments, with each person using their own ChatGPT.\",[9611],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9612,\"_286\":-7},\"Create and collaborate on Pages\",[9614,9615,9616,9617,9618],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9626,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9622,\"_274\":9623},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9621,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":7195,\"_274\":9619},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[9620],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":3226,\"_286\":-7},\". For availability and usage, see: \",\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/environments/cloud-environments\",[9624],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9625,\"_286\":-7},\"Set up and configure Codex Cloud\",\"To connect repositories and prepare an environment, see: \",[9628],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9629,\"_286\":-7},\"Codex Cloud lets you start and continue coding tasks from desktop, web, or mobile using reusable environments with your project’s repositories, tools, and dependencies. Each task gets its own isolated workspace, and tasks can continue while your computer is asleep. In managed workspaces, your workspace’s Codex cloud-access settings apply.\",[9631],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9632,\"_286\":-7},\"Codex Cloud\",[9634,9635,9636],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":2272,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9502,\"_274\":9637},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},[9638],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9639,\"_286\":-7},\"ChatGPT Pro tiers\",[9641],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9642,\"_286\":-7},\"Among Pro plans, Ultrafast is available only with Pro 500. Buying credits on Pro 100 or Pro 200 does not unlock it. Pro 500 subscriptions are available through ChatGPT on the web at launch.\",[9644],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9645,\"_286\":-7},\"We’re introducing Pro 500, a new $500/month plan with the highest included usage of the Pro plans and access to Astra Ultrafast in ChatGPT Work and Codex. Select Ultrafast in the model picker to use a faster service tier for GPT-6 Astra. It uses your included allowance first, then your credit balance after that allowance is used.\",[9647],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9648,\"_286\":-7},\"A new Pro plan with Astra Ultrafast\",[9650],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9651,\"_286\":-7},\"September 29, 2026\",[9653,9654,9655,9656,9657,9658,9659,9660],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9698},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9694},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9691},{\"_270\":365,\"_288\":9674},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9671},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9667},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9664},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9661},[9662],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9663,\"_286\":-7},\"To get started, open the camera in ChatGPT, tap the three-dot menu, and select Scan. Rolling out on iOS. \",[9665],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9666,\"_286\":-7},\"It’s now easier to bring your notes and documents into ChatGPT on your phone. Capture multiple pages in a row, and ChatGPT automatically combines them into a single PDF, ready to upload to your chat. \",[9668],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9669,\"_286\":9670},\"Scan notes and documents more easily with ChatGPT camera\",[591],[9672],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9673,\"_286\":-7},\"Available in ChatGPT on mobile and web.\",[9675,9676],[9684],[9677],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9678},[9679,9680],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9682,\"_286\":9683},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9681,\"_286\":-7},\" Save any product to Favorites or create a folder to organize your finds in your ChatGPT Library.\",\"Save your finds:\",[591],{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9685},[9686,9687],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9689,\"_286\":9690},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9688,\"_286\":-7},\" A “Try on” button will appear on product listings for clothes and accessories in ChatGPT. Select it, then take or upload a selfie to generate a virtual try-on with ChatGPT Images. Your reference photo is saved for future try-ons. You can change or delete it in Settings → Personalization → Reference photos.\",\"Virtually try on clothing and accessories:\",[591],[9692],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9693,\"_286\":-7},\"See how clothes and accessories could look on you and save your favorites for later.\",[9695],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9696,\"_286\":9697},\"New ways to shop in ChatGPT\",[591],[9699],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9700,\"_286\":-7},\"October 1, 2026\",[9702,9703,9704,9705],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9717},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9713},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9710},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9706},[9707],{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9163,\"_274\":9708},[9709],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9166,\"_286\":-7},[9711],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9712,\"_286\":-7},\"Finances in ChatGPT is rolling out to Free and Go users in the U.S. on web, iOS, and Android. You can securely connect your financial accounts to find ways to save, understand your spending, and make sense of your investments, with answers grounded in your finances.\",[9714],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9715,\"_286\":9716},\"Finances expands to Free and Go users\",[591],[9718],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9719,\"_286\":-7},\"October 2, 2026\",[9721,9722,9723],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9736},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9733},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9724},[9725,9726,9727],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9732,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9728,\"_274\":9729},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":1935,\"_286\":-7},\"https://help.openai.com/articles/8555545\",[9730],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9731,\"_286\":-7},\"Uploading files and audio to ChatGPT\",\"Upload audio files to ChatGPT to create transcripts, summarize recordings, and ask questions about their contents. You can turn a meeting, interview, or lecture into structured notes or a follow-up email draft. To get started, attach a supported audio file to a conversation and describe what you need.\\n\\nAudio uploads are available with paid ChatGPT subscriptions and workspaces. Availability may vary by workspace settings, region, client version, and model. Transcripts may contain errors, and performance may vary across languages.\\n\\nFor more information, see: \",[9734],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9735,\"_286\":-7},\"Audio uploads in ChatGPT\",[9737],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9738,\"_286\":-7},\"October 6, 2026\",[9740,9741,9742],{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":315,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9756},{\"_270\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":-7,\"_274\":9752},{\"_270\":281,\"_274\":9743},[9744,9745,9746],{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":5987,\"_286\":-7},{\"_270\":401,\"_26\":9748,\"_274\":9749},{\"_270\":284,\"_284\":9747,\"_286\":-7},\". ChatGPT can now combine text, visuals, and interactive elements to fit your question, from side-by-side comparisons and diagrams to tools you can use directly in the conversation, such as calculators, bill splitters, and games. It can choose the format automatically, and still use a simple text answer when that works best.\\n\\nGPT-6 can also begin answering while it 